{"server":"cn","storyId":"act49side_level_act49side_06_end","groupId":"act49side","stageId":"act49side_06","title":"裹锋","storyCode":"TA-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act49side/level_act49side_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"9405d8bf55a3756ef5187e86e97d0361912dac048a1489d93cafe0eeec7fd70b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g7_zuosroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>望日前一日 巳时</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"有些苍老的将军在军帐中长久地沉默伫立着，仿佛古老城墙上的砖石。\n身后是在心中已经描摹过上万遍的行军图，眼前是隐约可见轮廓的百灶城。\n见惯了西北的黄沙，中原的雨天反倒令人难以适应。阴云低垂，叫人透不过气。\n将军的思绪飘出去很远。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足下就是新任玉门守将吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"称呼我为朔便好，在下的职责是在军中一应事务上协助将军，另外身兼这里的武学教习。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要的话，在下可以先带将军熟悉一下军中环境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不认得我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下在朝廷下发的通告中见过左宣辽将军的名字......你说的“认得”指的是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用不着你带路，我是调迁回到玉门，早些年也是在玉门扛过刀的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，反倒是在下自作主张了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来早在那个时候，你我就已经是同袍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里戍边太久，有不少事情记不清了，如有冒犯，还请将军包涵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记不清了......哼，有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准备一下，我们校场练练。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军一路舟车劳顿，还是先好好休息。如果将军往后还有兴致，在下乐意奉陪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少废话，有什么好休息的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先活动一下拳脚，才吃得下饭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左将军，到此为止吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"军队跋涉作战，军需，士气，都已经到极限了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与邪魔作战不得用强，再孤军深入恐怕有变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"功亏一篑......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军，这一战成果已然可观。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这北祟邪魔以人心中畏惧为食......如左将军这样，第一次将整支军队的安危扛在肩上，却没有丝毫怯意的将领，在下也是平生仅见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有何可怕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伤我将士百姓，毁我城市良田......我只恨这一战不能把这些东西赶尽杀绝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假我二十年，以此剑为界，我必然平定所有作乱祟物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下当然相信将军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朔","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以左将军的胆魄，这世上怕是没有什么能让你畏退之敌了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看上去刀枪不入，战无不胜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怕过吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"调任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在玉门的任期以百年为限，如今也该做好离任的准备了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台现在是越发不讲规矩，玉门的人事变动都不先和我打招呼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近些年西北方向动荡，正是用人之际，怎么说走就走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的时日长了，看来左将军都已经忘了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下在玉门，从未领过官职。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"调去哪里？丹燕，还是芈楚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次离开玉门，应当是要彻底卸任了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近些年监测岁陵的秉烛人频繁传报，恐怕离祂苏醒的时日又近了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的时候，自然不太适合担任要职了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过如今玉门兵精将足，城坚炮利，无论是镇守大炎西北疆域，或是另作他用，都定能胜任。将军不必担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卸任之后......你又往何处去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偌大江湖，总该有去处......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g7_zuosroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......来人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前线的斥候还没有回来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"禀将军，不曾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近三日，也不曾收到百灶任何指令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论岁陵中状况如何，司岁台总该与玉门有所联络才是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"传我命令，现在即刻派信使——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军！这些人非要闯进来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监军御史","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左将军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是监军御史，这样擅闯我的军帐也该有个说法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们奉谁的命令？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监军御史","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回禀将军，是太尉遣我来，问责左将军贻误战机之罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒唐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自从玉门接受备战军令以来，全体将士枕戈待旦，何曾耽误过一条军令？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监军御史","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左将军难道忘了，玉门在年初便已收到军令，要求玉门在七月晦日便赶至百灶，却迟了整整三日才到达，这算不算贻误战机？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是因为玉门年初的时候意外撞上了天灾，足足耽误了两个月的工夫，朝中如何不知——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可放肆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......玉门城行进耽误，的确是本将之罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那太尉这个时候问责此事，莫非是打算临阵换帅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监军御史","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军明明清楚，太尉大人对您向来关照赏识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监军御史","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可如今看来，却是左将军不太信任太尉大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"军事重地，别说这种混账话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监军御史","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请左将军下令，将玉门往岁陵方向开动二十里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉门已经在备战的极限距离，为何还要靠近？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"岁陵中事态如何尚不明了，难道是要玉门主动攻击？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监军御史","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左将军只管听令，何须质疑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那陛下又如何裁断？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监军御史","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左将军难道要质疑军令？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不清不楚的军令，本将不敢接！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监军御史","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然不敢接令，那就只好请左将军让出这间军帐了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看谁敢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都给我住手！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监军御史","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左将军，此刻我出现在这里，太尉的意思已经明确了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监军御史","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您此刻只需听命，哪怕事后陛下追问起来，也自有分说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监军御史","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"岁兽将醒，开战已是定局，难道在这个时候，您还要坚持抗命，让玉门自乱阵脚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监军御史","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事态紧急，炎国亿万百姓生死全在将军一念之间——也包括您还在京城中的夫人与公子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们竟敢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监军御史","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我们，而是将军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监军御史","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按兵部的估算，只要左将军继续抗命，玉门无所作为，百灶遭殃就是板上钉钉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监军御史","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间紧张，我们候在这里，等左将军想清楚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g9_dalitemple"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还熟悉吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"变了几番样貌，但还是一眼认得出是决断天下公理的决院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然已经这么多年没有回来，又为什么偏偏赶回来凑这个热闹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人约见了我，不得不赴约。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你还是抽出空来了趟大理寺，是想看看这些后辈有没有令你失望？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的意见不足挂齿，大理寺只应该谋求不让天下百姓失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真可惜，这里不久前才有一位大理寺少卿辞职了——你应该会很喜欢她的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿她不是因为失望才辞职。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可就难说了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还弹琴吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五音正德，一日不忘——最近也在尝试一些新的乐器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不错......听上去比研究《炎律》来得轻松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的确是一门有趣的学问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年仔细研读过你在很久之前留下的那一册《炎律初理》，不知读了多少遍，其中三成的内容我无论如何理解不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是为了研究这本书，我险些没能进入刑部——转而去当秉烛人也并非不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到过去许多年，我才真的读懂了......你笔下的公正，不在人间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人画不出见所未见之物，笔下同样写不出心中不存的良知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果在人间看不见公正，那应当想想——是受何人所蒙蔽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你依然对当年那件事有恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道我不该？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那当年因为那场动乱丧生的人，无故被卷入棋局之人，应该恨他吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同样该恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，你要如何为此事求一个公正的判决？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你忘了才对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有哪一条炎律，是单纯为消弭仇恨而存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在需要审判的，另有其人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看上去你并不担心你的兄长在岁陵中的结果，反而更担忧他会受到什么样的审判？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公正本就与生死无关，我和他，各有所求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说得对啊......可越是这种时候，我越是会发自内心地觉得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"均，法与律是人所创设之物，可你心中那超越俗世纷争的崇高律法......恐怕永远也不可能出现在人间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但仅此一次......如果真的到了要审判那名罪人的时候，我会请你坐在审判席上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的的确不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我也已经很久没有审判过任何人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告辞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不忙。动身之前，先陪我喝杯人间的茶如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"均","speakerId":"avg_npc_2126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谌彻","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些时候，这人间的茶，哪怕是天上的神仙要品，到底还得是人来泡，人来奉，才能品出最合适的滋味。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_g4_tjdiscussionroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>望日前一日 酉时</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......这天镜阁也真够大的。前面就是天镜阁最顶层封印的房间了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们谁去敲敲门，琢磨一下怎么能打开？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里没有人，我们应该是最先赶到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......左乐，我还有一事不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然太尉有意要拿取代理人的遗物，他应该知晓该如何利用它来平息岁兽之乱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他贵为三公，如果他要，那他应该的确已经想好该怎么做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至怀疑......如果有人趁望与岁兽死斗之际，用这柄书刀，再删去一位代理人的名字......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是这一切，与魏彦吾到底......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那老太尉要是真有这样的能耐，也用不上什么书刀了，我看他亲自下岁陵把岁给除了都来得省事些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你又有何高见？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来对你们官家事不感兴趣，刚才听你们嚷嚷半天，我大概也听明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，就是四十年前涉嫌犯上作乱，又下落不明的那位太子，如今又回来了，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈昭芊","speakerId":"avg_npc_2128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这等大事，不容你这样随意谈论！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，懒得和你讲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，另一位有着纯正真龙血脉的人现在就在百灶城中，也就是说，现在这样的话倒是好解释了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底想说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道你们没有听说过，埋藏在百灶城下，用以镇压岁兽的那枚特殊的源石？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位从龙门远道而来的陈小姐不知道还在情理之中，你们二位也不知道......应该是职级不够？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈昭芊","speakerId":"avg_npc_2128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈昭芊","speakerId":"avg_npc_2128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“地泽万民，赐此奇石；天祐炎祚，得诛孽岁。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈昭芊","speakerId":"avg_npc_2128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这与大狩猎相关的传说，我一直以为是神话中的神话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，整个岁陵，都维系在一样特殊的机关之上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我猜你们不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你又为什么这么清楚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜司岁台的记录上，一定也不会提及是谁把这枚源石送给了炎国。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是矩兽的第一位好友，最初的山海众，我们的祖师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫佚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1871_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准确来说，他只把这颗源石送给了真龙一人......也就是说——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈昭芊","speakerId":"avg_npc_2128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应该是百灶已经完成平民疏散工作，准备开始拆分移动地块了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间很紧急，我们应该立即去取——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们竟然真的闯到了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"漫长走廊的另一头，一人踱步而出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，会是您——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g5_dragonpalace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禁军","speakerId":"avg_npc_1634_1","isRemote":false,"text":"启奏陛下，百灶各城区的疏散工作已全部完成，各部官员皆已就位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禁军","speakerId":"avg_npc_1634_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听候陛下下一步指令。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真龙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天，就是望日了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禁军","speakerId":"avg_npc_1634_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真龙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真龙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将百灶拆分吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_i11"},{"type":"narration","text":"残阳熔金，穹宇震鸣。\n百灶城外围的各个区块渐次与核心区域分离，巨构辗转，于辽阔的荒野间投下驳杂的暗影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_i11"},{"type":"narration","text":"它们是这座城市的行远之足，更是这座城市的立命根基。\n山水，长街，烟火，弦歌。\n锻坊，百谷，宰府，兵革......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_i11"},{"type":"narration","text":"各区协同，遍历百代人事春秋。\n八域不散，九州同举。\n然此番分离，前路......未卜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g5_dragonpalace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真龙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真龙","speakerId":"avg_npc_2132_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还想着，你到底什么时候会来找我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是时候了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
